{"3756600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Cleaners", "steam_appid": 3756600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Cleaners</strong> is a cooperative game for up to 4 cleaners, where your job is to clean various treasure chambers left in disarray by the <span class=\"bb_strike\">exploded</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">crushed</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">disassembled</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">half-digested</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">broken</span> remains of heroic knights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/368b3bb4d2530871fb4671845ad348ed.avif?t=1774606400\" width=846 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no time to slack off or light up a cigarette! The floor must be cleaned as quickly as possible. There’s no proof the dungeon is actually monster-free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/cd3d529258c52d4509b403473f2c63bd.poster.avif?t=1774606400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/cd3d529258c52d4509b403473f2c63bd.webm?t=1774606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/cd3d529258c52d4509b403473f2c63bd.mp4?t=1774606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/ea72b8f5345d2c83b89ce7856f568071.avif?t=1774606400\" width=653 height=121 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the Middle Ages, you can find traces of cryptocurrency. Work hard or resell items left behind by fallen knights to stack up Stable Coins and invest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/eb3769f972884bf385c54a18b2b25de9.poster.avif?t=1774606400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/eb3769f972884bf385c54a18b2b25de9.webm?t=1774606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/eb3769f972884bf385c54a18b2b25de9.mp4?t=1774606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/1c62827e1c1ac8ffc4b6e09f4fbff72a.avif?t=1774606400\" width=664 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning a dungeon isn’t just about mopping the floor. Danger still lurks, not all traps have been disarmed, and nothing guarantees the monsters are truly gone. Stay alert, work as a team, and know when to retreat at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/300e4b3ae51b2befe6b47d0fb2090363.poster.avif?t=1774606400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/300e4b3ae51b2befe6b47d0fb2090363.webm?t=1774606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/300e4b3ae51b2befe6b47d0fb2090363.mp4?t=1774606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=